; Cutscene actor lists of the ending: a count, then 4-byte records
;
; Two lists loaded by #R$8870 for the ending sequence #R$887B: the first byte of a list is the number of records
; (copied to #R$8552) and the records are copied to the object list at $5DC0, from where #R$8905 spawns them as
; objects. A record is 4 bytes: the address of an actor template in $BD80-$BDC8 (word), then the x and y of the actor
; in 2-pixel units, added to the offsets in the template.
; .
; The first list (1 record: template $BD80 at x=$34, y=$6C) is loaded for the first part of the ending, in room 25;
; the second list (8 records: templates $BD92, $BDA4 three times, $BDC8 twice and $BDB6 twice) for the second part, in
; room 4. Each cutscene runs until one of the actors sets #R$8501.
@label=CutsceneList1
b$83A8 DEFB $01
 $83A9 DEFB $80,$BD,$34,$6C
@label=CutsceneList2
 $83AD DEFB $08
 $83AE DEFB $92,$BD,$3A,$3E
 $83B2 DEFB $A4,$BD,$44,$36
 $83B6 DEFB $A4,$BD,$44,$3E
 $83BA DEFB $A4,$BD,$44,$46
 $83BE DEFB $C8,$BD,$44,$14
 $83C2 DEFB $C8,$BD,$44,$24
 $83C6 DEFB $B6,$BD,$44,$54
 $83CA DEFB $B6,$BD,$44,$60
